From: Gatien Chevallier <gatien.chevallier@foss.st.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Jun 2025 18:20:51 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 188/913] dt-bindings: clock: expose PCIE bus clock as an SCMI
 clock

Because the PCIE shares its bus clock with the RISAF5 that is covering
the PCIE memory, and because the RISAF5 is handled by OP-TEE, this
clock should be managed with the SCMI protocol.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git f09872d2e12b95f6fe7879a1d761694bd38a0c61 dt-bindings: clock: expose PCIE bus clock as an SCMI clock]
Change-Id: Iae12f53d07de98fdfc2509cf482c46402b0d2139
Signed-off-by: Gatien Chevallier <gatien.chevallier@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/468579
Reviewed-by: Thomas BOURGOIN <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Gabriel FERNANDEZ <gabriel.fernandez@foss.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
Domain-Review: Patrick DELAUNAY <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Gatien CHEVALLIER <gatien.chevallier@st.com>
Tested-by: Gatien CHEVALLIER <gatien.chevallier@st.com>
---
 core/include/dt-bindings/clock/st,stm32mp25-rcc.h | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/core/include/dt-bindings/clock/st,stm32mp25-rcc.h b/core/include/dt-bindings/clock/st,stm32mp25-rcc.h
index 9c1f25923..7d87ffa54 100644
--- a/core/include/dt-bindings/clock/st,stm32mp25-rcc.h
+++ b/core/include/dt-bindings/clock/st,stm32mp25-rcc.h
@@ -527,5 +527,6 @@
 #define CK_SCMI_IPCC2_AM	129
 #define CK_SCMI_LPDMA_AM	130
 #define CK_SCMI_RTC_AM		131
+#define CK_SCMI_ICN_PCIE	132
 
 #endif /* _DT_BINDINGS_CLOCK_ST_STM32MP25_RCC_H_ */
